    "soalHtml": "<p class=\"font-medium text-slate-800 leading-relaxed mb-3\">\nPeserta didik melakukan praktikum uji aktivitas enzim katalase menggunakan ekstrak hati ayam segar yang direaksikan dengan hidrogen peroksida (H<sub>2</sub>O<sub>2</sub>) pada berbagai kondisi lingkungan. Diperoleh data sebagai berikut:\n</p>\n<div class=\"my-3 overflow-x-auto\">\n  <table class=\"w-full text-xs sm:text-sm text-left border-collapse border border-slate-300 rounded-xl overflow-hidden shadow-xs\">\n    <thead class=\"bg-indigo-700 text-white font-semibold\">\n      <tr>\n        <th class=\"p-2 border border-indigo-800 text-center\">Tabung</th>\n        <th class=\"p-2 border border-indigo-800\">Perlakuan Ekstrak Hati + H2O2</th>\n        <th class=\"p-2 border border-indigo-800 text-center\">Gelembung Gas</th>\n        <th class=\"p-2 border border-indigo-800 text-center\">Bara Api Lidi</th>\n      </tr>\n    </thead>\n    <tbody class=\"divide-y divide-slate-200 bg-white\">\n      <tr>\n        <td class=\"p-2 border border-slate-200 text-center font-bold\">1</td>\n        <td class=\"p-2 border border-slate-200\">Kondisi Netral (suhu 37°C)</td>\n        <td class=\"p-2 border border-slate-200 text-center font-bold text-teal-600\">++++ (Sangat banyak)</td>\n        <td class=\"p-2 border border-slate-200 text-center font-bold text-teal-600\">Menyala terang</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr class=\"bg-slate-50\">\n        <td class=\"p-2 border border-slate-200 text-center font-bold\">2</td>\n        <td class=\"p-2 border border-slate-200\">Ditambah HCl encer (pH asam)</td>\n        <td class=\"p-2 border border-slate-200 text-center\">+ (Sangat sedikit)</td>\n        <td class=\"p-2 border border-slate-200 text-center\">Redup / Mati</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td class=\"p-2 border border-slate-200 text-center font-bold\">3</td>\n        <td class=\"p-2 border border-slate-200\">Ditambah NaOH encer (pH basa)</td>\n        <td class=\"p-2 border border-slate-200 text-center\">+ (Sedikit)</td>\n        <td class=\"p-2 border border-slate-200 text-center\">Redup / Mati</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr class=\"bg-slate-50\">\n        <td class=\"p-2 border border-slate-200 text-center font-bold\">4</td>\n        <td class=\"p-2 border border-slate-200\">Dipanaskan pada suhu 80°C</td>\n        <td class=\"p-2 border border-slate-200 text-center font-bold text-rose-600\">- (Tidak ada)</td>\n        <td class=\"p-2 border border-slate-200 text-center font-bold text-rose-600\">Padam total</td>\n      </tr>\n    </tbody>\n  </table>\n</div>\n<p class=\"font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-2\">\nTentukan kebenaran dari masing-masing pernyataan interpretasi data praktikum di atas:\n</p>",
